privy-removal.md

# Build-process records, not documentation.
#
# STATUS.md is a gate-by-gate report of how the product was built, with pasted
# shell output; docs/cctp-capability.md is a point-in-time "can Circle do X"
# investigation that ends in a devnet faucet being empty. Both were useful while
# the work was happening and neither is something a new engineer should read to
# understand this codebase. Kept locally, out of the repo.
STATUS.md
docs/cctp-capability.md

# Progress record for the security hardening pass: phase, change, gate output.
# Same reasoning as STATUS.md -- it is how the work went, not what the code is.
whereistopped.md
